==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When the enemies come near your base, spawn some [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] (you will need at least 3 of them out at all times). When Those Guys appear, fire your [[Cat Cannon]]. Once you have upgraded the Worker Cat to level 4 or above, you can spawn [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] along with [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]] and meatshields, which you shall then continue to spam until Pigge is defeated.

If you have purchased [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]], use her in place of or in tandem with Axe Cat, as she is essentially better in every way.

