==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Tokushima Prefecture'''.
*Maldives and [[Hawaii (Empire of Cats)|Hawaii]] are the only locations visited in [[Empire of Cats]] not to appear in [[Into the Future]].
*Tokushima Prefecture's base is a dancer dressed for the [[wikipedia:Awa Dance Festival|Awa Dance Festival]], the prefecture's most famous attraction.

